g about what training cost."], "correctIndex": 1, "explanation": "At OpenAI, final runs were about 10% of R&D compute. Ask for the whole bill, not the last run."}, {"id": "lens-invest", "kind": "info", "title": "Value the full R&D bill", "body": "Final runs were about 10% to 23% of R&D compute at OpenAI, Z.ai and MiniMax. Model the whole program, not one run.", "eyebrow": "For investors", "sources": [{"url": "https://epoch.ai/gradient-updates/r-and-d-vs-training-compute", "label": "Epoch AI, Final training runs account for a minority of R&D compute spending, Mar 2026"}]}, {"id": "rule", "kind": "microInsight", "text": "In AI, the final training run is only a slice of what a model costs.", "eyebrow": "The rule", "sources": [{"url": "https://epoch.ai/gradient-updates/r-and-d-vs-training-compute", "label": "Epoch AI, Final training runs account for a minority of R&D compute spending, Mar 2026"}, {"url": "https://epoch.ai/publications/how-much-does-it-cost-to-train-frontier-ai-models", "label": "Epoch AI, How much does it cost to train frontier AI models?, Jun 2024"}]}, {"id": "say-it", "kind": "sayIt", "takeaway": "OpenAI spent about $5 billion on R&D compute in 2024 and only about $500 million on final training runs. Staff and experiments make the full bill much bigger than the headline.", "sectionKey": "watchlist"}]}$ml$::jsonb),
