 "https://epoch.ai/publications/how-much-does-it-cost-to-train-frontier-ai-models", "label": "Epoch AI, How much does it cost to train frontier AI models?, Jun 2024"}]}, {"kind": "info", "id": "shares", "eyebrow": "The full bill", "title": "Chips first, people second, power last", "body": "Across four models including GPT-4 and Gemini Ultra, hardware was 47% to 67% of development cost. Energy was only 2% to 6%.", "bullets": ["Epoch's headline costs count hardware and energy for the final run only."], "sources": [{"url": "https://epoch.ai/publications/how-much-does-it-cost-to-train-frontier-ai-models", "label": "Epoch AI, How much does it cost to train frontier AI models?, Jun 2024"}]}, {"kind": "numberSense", "id": "ns-final", "prompt": "OpenAI spent about $5 billion on R&D compute in 2024. About how many millions went to final training runs?", "min": 0, "max": 2000, "value": 500, "unit": "M", "explanation": "About $500 million, roughly 10%. The rest went to experiments, synthetic data and basic research."}, {"kind": "sortSignal", "id": "sort", "prompt": "Is it in the headline training cost, or only in the full bill?", "buckets": ["Headline cost", "Only the full bill"], "items": [{"text": "GPUs for the run that ships", "bucket": 0}, {"text": "Energy for that final run", "bucket": 0}, {"text": "Hundreds of test runs", "bucket": 1}, {"text": "Researcher salaries and equity", "bucket": 1}], "explanation": "Headline estimates count hardware and energy for the final run. Experiments and staff only show up in the full development cost."}, {"kind": "theCall", "id": "call", "situation": "A startup says it trained its model for $3 million. It wants your money to build the next one.", "prompt": "What do you ask first?", "options": ["Which cloud provider it trained on", "What its research and test runs cost", "How many people use the model today"], "consequences": ["The provider matters less than the full bill.", "The final run can be a small slice of total R&D compute.", "Usage says nothing about what training cost."], "correctIndex": 1, "explanation": "At OpenAI, final runs were about 10% of R&D compute. Ask for the whole bill, not the last run."}, {"id": "lens-build_startup", "kind": "info", "title": "Budget for the runs that fail", "body": "Most compute goes to experiments before the final run. Plan your budget around them, not just the run that ships.", "eyebrow": "For founders", "sources": [{"url": "https://epoch.ai/gradient-updates/r-and-d-vs-training-compute", "label": "Epoch AI, Final training runs account for a minority of R&D compute spending, Mar 2026"}]}, {"id": "rule", "kind": "microInsight", "text": "In AI, the final training run is only a slice of what a model costs.", "eyebrow": "The rule", "sources": [{"url": "https://epoch.ai/gradient-updates/r-and-d-vs-training-compute", "label": "Epoch AI, Final training runs account for a minority of R&D compute spending, Mar 2026"}, {"url": "https://epoch.ai/publications/how-much-does-it-cost-to-train-frontier-ai-models", "label": "Epoch AI, How much does it cost to train frontier AI models?, Jun 2024"}]}, {"id": "say-it", "kind": "sayIt", "takeaway": "OpenAI spent about $5 billion on R&D compute in 2024 and only about $500 million on final training runs. Staff and experiments make the full bill much bigger than the headline.", "sectionKey": "money"}]}$ml$::jsonb),
