pic-raises-30-billion-series-g-funding-380-billion-post-money-valuation", "label": "Anthropic, Series G at a $380 billion valuation, Feb 2026"}]}, {"kind": "info", "id": "three", "eyebrow": "Who pays", "title": "Shares, sales and loans", "body": "Labs sell shares, earn revenue and borrow from banks. Some investors are also suppliers: Microsoft and NVIDIA put money into Anthropic's round.", "bullets": ["Anthropic buys compute across AWS Trainium, Google TPUs and NVIDIA GPUs."], "sources": [{"url": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/anthropic-raises-30-billion-series-g-funding-380-billion-post-money-valuation", "label": "Anthropic, Series G at a $380 billion valuation, Feb 2026"}, {"url": "https://www.openai.com/index/accelerating-the-next-phase-ai/", "label": "OpenAI, Accelerating the next phase of AI, Mar 2026"}]}, {"kind": "faceOff", "id": "face", "prompt": "Which funding round was larger?", "left": {"name": "OpenAI, March 2026", "note": "At an $852 billion valuation"}, "right": {"name": "Anthropic, February 2026", "note": "At a $380 billion valuation"}, "correctIndex": 0, "explanation": "OpenAI raised $122 billion. Anthropic raised $30 billion seven weeks earlier."}, {"kind": "numberSense", "id": "ns-rev", "prompt": "OpenAI said its revenue was about $2 billion a month. About how many billions is that a year?", "min": 0, "max": 100, "value": 24, "unit": "B", "explanation": "About $24 billion a year, still far below the $122 billion it just raised."}, {"kind": "theCall", "id": "call", "situation": "You run finance at an AI lab. Revenue grows fast, but next year's compute bill is three times this year's revenue.", "prompt": "How do you pay for it?", "options": ["Wait for revenue to cover the bill first", "Cancel the run and sell the chips", "Raise equity and keep a credit line ready"], "consequences": ["Funded rivals keep training while you wait.", "You give up the frontier entirely.", "OpenAI paired its $122 billion round with a credit line."], "correctIndex": 2, "explanation": "Frontier labs fund compute ahead of revenue with equity, and keep debt in reserve."}, {"id": "lens-build_startup", "kind": "info", "title": "Capital is the moat at the frontier", "body": "Rounds of $30 billion and $122 billion fund the frontier. Startups compete where that much money is not needed.", "eyebrow": "For founders", "sources": [{"url": "https://www.openai.com/index/accelerating-the-next-phase-ai/", "label": "OpenAI, Accelerating the next phase of AI, Mar 2026"}, {"url": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/anthropic-raises-30-billion-series-g-funding-380-billion-post-money-valuation", "label": "Anthropic, Series G at a $380 billion valuation, Feb 2026"}]}, {"id": "rule", "kind": "microInsight", "text": "In AI, the frontier is paid for with investors' money before it pays for itself.", "eyebrow": "The rule", "sources": [{"url": "https://www.openai.com/index/accelerating-the-next-phase-ai/", "label": "OpenAI, Accelerating the next phase of AI, Mar 2026"}, {"url": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/anthropic-raises-30-billion-series-g-funding-380-billion-post-money-valuation", "label": "Anthropic, Series G at a $380 billion valuation, Feb 2026"}, {"url": "https://www.thestar.com.my/tech/tech-news/2026/09/19/openai-forecasts-cash-burn-near-280-billion-by-2030-ft-reports", "label": "Reuters via The Star, OpenAI forecasts cash burn near $280 billion by 2030, Sep 2026"}]}, {"id": "say-it", "kind": "sayIt", "takeaway": "OpenAI raised $122 billion in March 2026 and Anthropic $30 billion in February. Frontier labs fund compute by selling shares, ahead of their revenue.", "sectionKey": "gap"}]}$ml$::jsonb),
