": "Frontier labs fund compute ahead of revenue with equity, and keep debt in reserve."}, {"id": "lens-curiosity", "kind": "info", "title": "Two rounds in seven weeks", "body": "Anthropic raised $30 billion in February 2026. OpenAI raised $122 billion at the end of March.", "eyebrow": "Why it matters", "sources": [{"url": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/anthropic-raises-30-billion-series-g-funding-380-billion-post-money-valuation", "label": "Anthropic, Series G at a $380 billion valuation, Feb 2026"}, {"url": "https://www.openai.com/index/accelerating-the-next-phase-ai/", "label": "OpenAI, Accelerating the next phase of AI, Mar 2026"}]}, {"id": "rule", "kind": "microInsight", "text": "In AI, the frontier is paid for with investors' money before it pays for itself.", "eyebrow": "The rule", "sources": [{"url": "https://www.openai.com/index/accelerating-the-next-phase-ai/", "label": "OpenAI, Accelerating the next phase of AI, Mar 2026"}, {"url": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/anthropic-raises-30-billion-series-g-funding-380-billion-post-money-valuation", "label": "Anthropic, Series G at a $380 billion valuation, Feb 2026"}, {"url": "https://www.thestar.com.my/tech/tech-news/2026/09/19/openai-forecasts-cash-burn-near-280-billion-by-2030-ft-reports", "label": "Reuters via The Star, OpenAI forecasts cash burn near $280 billion by 2030, Sep 2026"}]}, {"id": "say-it", "kind": "sayIt", "takeaway": "OpenAI raised $122 billion in March 2026 and Anthropic $30 billion in February. Frontier labs fund compute by selling shares, ahead of their revenue.", "sectionKey": "chain"}]}$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$62ccbcdb-cace-560d-862f-c22232d9c5c3$ml$::uuid, $ml$ai$ml$, $ml$When your investor is your supplier$ml$, 'LESSON', ARRAY[$ml$MICRO_LESSON$ml$, $ml$day-39$ml$, $ml$month-2$ml$, $ml$handwritten-v1$ml$, $ml$goal:career$ml$, $ml$level:beginner$ml$, $ml$level:intermediate$ml$, $ml$level:advanced$ml$]::text[], 5, now(), '{}'::jsonb, $ml${"id": "ai-d39-career", "title": "When your investor is your supplier", "exercises": [{"id": "open", "kind": "coldOpen", "kicker": "The money comes back as sales.", "eyebrow": "Day 39 · The power", "headline": "In November 2025, Microsoft and NVIDIA pledged up to $15 billion to Anthropic. Anthropic pledged to buy $30 billion of Azure compute.", "fullText": "NVIDIA committed up to $10 billion and Microsoft up to $5 billion. Its initial commitment of up to one gigawatt is for NVIDIA Grace Blackwell and Vera Rubin systems. Microsoft's Foundry customers also gained access to Claude models. The investors also sell the compute their money pays for.", "sources": [{"url": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/microsoft-nvidia-anthropic-announce-strategic-partnerships", "label": "Anthropic, Microsoft, NVIDIA and Anthropic announce strategic partnerships, Nov 2025"}]}, {"kind": "microInsight", "id": "loop", "eyebrow": "The loop", "text": "A supplier invests in a lab, and the lab spends with the supplier.", "highlight": "Anthropic's $30 billion Azure pledge is twice what its two backers pledged.", "sources": [{"url": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/microsoft-nvidia-anthropic-announce-strategic-partnerships", "label": "Anthropic, Microsoft, NVIDIA and Anthropic announce strategic partnerships, Nov 2025"}]}, {"kind": "microInsight", "id": "openai", "eyebrow": "The same pattern", "text": "Microsoft owns about 27% of OpenAI, a stake valued around $135 billion.", "highlight": "OpenAI committed to buy $250 billion of Azure services.", "sources": [{"url": "https://www.scmp.com/tech/big-tech/article/3330714/microsoft-holds-27-openai-revamped-partnership", "label": "SCMP, Microsoft holds 27% of OpenAI in revamped partnership, Oct 2025"}, {"url": "https://rcpmag.com/Articles/2025/10/28/Microsoft-OpenAI-AGI.aspx", "label": "Redmond Channel Partner, Microsoft and OpenAI reset their deal, Oct 2025"}]}, {"kind": "info", "id": "leverage", "eyebrow": "Who holds the leverage", "title": "Labs push back by spreading out", "body": "In October 2025, Microsoft gave up its right of first refusal as OpenAI's compute provider. OpenAI now buys from several clouds.", "bullets": ["Anthropic runs on AWS Trainium, Google TPUs and NVIDIA GPUs."], "keyTerms": [{"term": "Right of first refusal", "definition": "The right to match a rival's offer before the other side can accept it."}], "sources": [{"url": "https://rcpmag.com/Articles/2025/10/28/Microsoft-OpenAI-AGI.aspx", "label": "Redmond Channel Partner, Microsoft and OpenAI reset their deal, Oct 2025"}, {"url": "https://www.openai.com/index/accelerating-the-next-phase-ai/", "label": "OpenAI, Accelerating the next phase of AI, Mar 2026"}, {"url": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/anthropic-raises-30-billion-series-g-funding-380-billion-post-money-valuation", "label": "Anthropic, Series G at a $380 billion valuation, Feb 2026"}]}, {"kind": "buildChain", "id": "chain", "prompt": "Follow the money around the loop.", "steps": ["NVIDIA and Microsoft invest in Anthropic", "Anthropic commits $30 billion to Azure", "Azure runs that compute on NVIDIA systems", "The money returns to the investors as sales"], "explanation": "The investment goes to the lab, the lab buys cloud compute, and the cloud runs on the investor's chips."}, {"kind": "multipleChoice", "id": "mc", "prompt": "What did Microsoft give up in its October 2025 deal with OpenAI?", "options": ["Its whole stake in OpenAI", "First refusal on OpenAI compute", "Its rights to OpenAI's models"], "correctIndex": 1, "explanation": "Microsoft kept about 27% and its model rights through 2032, but lost first refusal as compute provider."}, {"kind": "spotFake", "id": "fake", "prompt": "One of these is false. Tap it.", "statements": ["NVIDIA pledged up to $10 billion to Anthropic.", "OpenAI committed to buy $250 billion of Azure services.", "Anthropic agreed to run only on Microsoft hardware."], "fakeIndex": 2, "explanation": "Anthropic's compute spans AWS Trainium, Google TPUs and NVIDIA GPUs."}, {"id": "lens-career", "kind": "info", "title": "Ask who sells to the investors", "body": "Ask a lab which investors also sell it compute. Microsoft, NVIDIA and Amazon have each played both roles.", "eyebrow": "For your interview", "sources": [{"url": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/microsoft-nvidia-anthropic-announce-strategic-partnerships", "label": "Anthropic, Microsoft, NVIDIA and Anthropic announce strategic partnerships, Nov 2025"}, {"url": "https://www.openai.com/index/accelerating-the-next-phase-ai/", "label": "OpenAI, Accelerating the next phase of AI, Mar 2026"}]}, {"id": "rule", "kind": "microInsight", "text": "In AI, whoever sells the compute increasingly owns a piece of whoever buys it.", "eyebrow": "The rule", "sources": [{"url": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/microsoft-nvidia-anthropic-announce-strategic-partnerships", "label": "Anthropic, Microsoft, NVIDIA and Anthropic announce strategic partnerships, Nov 2025"}, {"url": "https://www.scmp.com/tech/big-tech/article/3330714/microsoft-holds-27-openai-revamped-partnership", "label": "SCMP, Microsoft holds 27% of OpenAI in revamped partnership, Oct 2025"}]}, {"id": "say-it", "kind": "sayIt", "takeaway": "Microsoft and NVIDIA pledged up to $15 billion to Anthropic, which pledged $30 billion back to Azure. Compute sellers now own stakes in their biggest buyers.", "sectionKey": "questions"}]}$ml$::jsonb),
