tnership", "label": "SCMP, Microsoft holds 27% of OpenAI in revamped partnership, Oct 2025"}, {"url": "https://rcpmag.com/Articles/2025/10/28/Microsoft-OpenAI-AGI.aspx", "label": "Redmond Channel Partner, Microsoft and OpenAI reset their deal, Oct 2025"}]}, {"kind": "info", "id": "leverage", "eyebrow": "Who holds the leverage", "title": "Labs push back by spreading out", "body": "In October 2025, Microsoft gave up its right of first refusal as OpenAI's compute provider. OpenAI now buys from several clouds.", "bullets": ["Anthropic runs on AWS Trainium, Google TPUs and NVIDIA GPUs."], "keyTerms": [{"term": "Right of first refusal", "definition": "The right to match a rival's offer before the other side can accept it."}], "sources": [{"url": "https://rcpmag.com/Articles/2025/10/28/Microsoft-OpenAI-AGI.aspx", "label": "Redmond Channel Partner, Microsoft and OpenAI reset their deal, Oct 2025"}, {"url": "https://www.openai.com/index/accelerating-the-next-phase-ai/", "label": "OpenAI, Accelerating the next phase of AI, Mar 2026"}, {"url": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/anthropic-raises-30-billion-series-g-funding-380-billion-post-money-valuation", "label": "Anthropic, Series G at a $380 billion valuation, Feb 2026"}]}, {"kind": "buildChain", "id": "chain", "prompt": "Follow the money around the loop.", "steps": ["NVIDIA and Microsoft invest in Anthropic", "Anthropic commits $30 billion to Azure", "Azure runs that compute on NVIDIA systems", "The money returns to the investors as sales"], "explanation": "The investment goes to the lab, the lab buys cloud compute, and the cloud runs on the investor's chips."}, {"kind": "multipleChoice", "id": "mc", "prompt": "What did Microsoft give up in its October 2025 deal with OpenAI?", "options": ["Its whole stake in OpenAI", "First refusal on OpenAI compute", "Its rights to OpenAI's models"], "correctIndex": 1, "explanation": "Microsoft kept about 27% and its model rights through 2032, but lost first refusal as compute provider."}, {"kind": "spotFake", "id": "fake", "prompt": "One of these is false. Tap it.", "statements": ["NVIDIA pledged up to $10 billion to Anthropic.", "OpenAI committed to buy $250 billion of Azure services.", "Anthropic agreed to run only on Microsoft hardware."], "fakeIndex": 2, "explanation": "Anthropic's compute spans AWS Trainium, Google TPUs and NVIDIA GPUs."}, {"id": "lens-build_startup", "kind": "info", "title": "Know what a backer expects", "body": "Chip and cloud firms invest in the labs that buy from them. Ask what a backer expects you to buy before you take its money.", "eyebrow": "For founders", "sources": [{"url": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/microsoft-nvidia-anthropic-announce-strategic-partnerships", "label": "Anthropic, Microsoft, NVIDIA and Anthropic announce strategic partnerships, Nov 2025"}, {"url": "https://www.scmp.com/tech/big-tech/article/3330714/microsoft-holds-27-openai-revamped-partnership", "label": "SCMP, Microsoft holds 27% of OpenAI in revamped partnership, Oct 2025"}]}, {"id": "rule", "kind": "microInsight", "text": "In AI, whoever sells the compute increasingly owns a piece of whoever buys it.", "eyebrow": "The rule", "sources": [{"url": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/microsoft-nvidia-anthropic-announce-strategic-partnerships", "label": "Anthropic, Microsoft, NVIDIA and Anthropic announce strategic partnerships, Nov 2025"}, {"url": "https://www.scmp.com/tech/big-tech/article/3330714/microsoft-holds-27-openai-revamped-partnership", "label": "SCMP, Microsoft holds 27% of OpenAI in revamped partnership, Oct 2025"}]}, {"id": "say-it", "kind": "sayIt", "takeaway": "Microsoft and NVIDIA pledged up to $15 billion to Anthropic, which pledged $30 billion back to Azure. Compute sellers now own stakes in their biggest buyers.", "sectionKey": "who_hurts"}]}$ml$::jsonb),
