 "correctIndex": 1, "explanation": "Epoch found cloud estimates about twice as high on average."}, {"id": "lens-invest", "kind": "info", "title": "Model the next run, not the last", "body": "At 2.4 times a year, a $490 million run implies a multibillion-dollar run within three years. Forecasts should assume it.", "eyebrow": "For investors", "sources": [{"url": "https://epoch.ai/publications/how-much-does-it-cost-to-train-frontier-ai-models", "label": "Epoch AI, How much does it cost to train frontier AI models?, Jun 2024"}, {"url": "https://epoch.ai/data-insights/grok-4-training-resources", "label": "Epoch AI, Grok 4 training resources, Sep 2025"}]}, {"id": "rule", "kind": "microInsight", "text": "In AI, the bill for the biggest training run multiplies every year.", "eyebrow": "The rule", "sources": [{"url": "https://epoch.ai/publications/how-much-does-it-cost-to-train-frontier-ai-models", "label": "Epoch AI, How much does it cost to train frontier AI models?, Jun 2024"}, {"url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.21015", "label": "Cottier et al., The rising costs of training frontier AI models, 2024"}]}, {"id": "say-it", "kind": "sayIt", "takeaway": "Epoch put Grok 4's training at about $490 million. Frontier run costs grow about 2.4 times a year, and Epoch expects them to pass $1 billion by 2027 if that holds.", "sectionKey": "numbers"}]}$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$8de5b25b-bc49-5ef2-97fc-918d8e13d94a$ml$::uuid, $ml$ai$ml$, $ml$Half a billion dollars for one run$ml$, 'LESSON', ARRAY[$ml$MICRO_LESSON$ml$, $ml$day-40$ml$, $ml$month-2$ml$, $ml$handwritten-v1$ml$, $ml$goal:build_startup$ml$, $ml$level:beginner$ml$, $ml$level:intermediate$ml$, $ml$level:advanced$ml$]::text[], 5, now(), '{}'::jsonb, $ml${"id": "ai-d40-build_startup", "title": "Half a billion dollars for one run", "exercises": [{"id": "open", "kind": "coldOpen", "kicker": "The biggest bill in AI grows every year.", "eyebrow": "Day 40 · The numbers", "headline": "Epoch AI estimated that training xAI's Grok 4 cost about $490 million and 310 gigawatt-hours of electricity.", "fullText": "Epoch published the estimate in September 2025. That much energy could power a town of 4,000 Americans. It leaves out staff, research experiments and serving users, which Epoch says can be very significant. Top labs no longer disclose details like training duration, so outsiders estimate.", "sources": [{"url": "https://epoch.ai/data-insights/grok-4-training-resources", "label": "Epoch AI, Grok 4 training resources, Sep 2025"}, {"url": "https://hai.stanford.edu/assets/files/ai_index_report_2026_chapter_1_research_development.pdf", "label": "Stanford AI Index 2026, chapter 1, Research and Development"}]}, {"kind": "microInsight", "id": "growth", "eyebrow": "The growth rate", "text": "The cost of the biggest training runs has grown about 2.4 times a year since 2016.", "highlight": "That is Epoch's estimate, counting hardware and energy for the final run.", "sources": [{"url": "https://epoch.ai/publications/how-much-does-it-cost-to-train-frontier-ai-models", "label": "Epoch AI, How much does it cost to train frontier AI models?, Jun 2024"}, {"url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.21015", "label": "Cottier et al., The rising costs of training frontier AI models, 2024"}]}, {"kind": "microInsight", "id": "rent", "eyebrow": "Rent or own", "text": "How you count changes the number.", "highlight": "Cloud rental estimates come out about twice as high as owned hardware.", "sources": [{"url": "https://epoch.ai/publications/how-much-does-it-cost-to-train-frontier-ai-models", "label": "Epoch AI, How much does it cost to train frontier AI models?, Jun 2024"}]}, {"kind": "info", "id": "billion", "eyebrow": "The next milestone", "title": "Runs over $1 billion by 2027", "body": "If the trend holds, Epoch expects the largest runs to cost more than $1 billion by 2027. That would keep the frontier to the best-funded labs.", "bullets": ["GPU compute per dollar doubles about every 2.1 years."], "sources": [{"url": "https://epoch.ai/publications/how-much-does-it-cost-to-train-frontier-ai-models", "label": "Epoch AI, How much does it cost to train frontier AI models?, Jun 2024"}, {"url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.21015", "label": "Cottier et al., The rising costs of training frontier AI models, 2024"}, {"url": "https://epoch.ai/publications/trends-in-machine-learning-hardware", "label": "Epoch AI, Trends in machine learning hardware, Nov 2023"}]}, {"kind": "numberSense", "id": "ns-growth", "prompt": "If the biggest run costs 2.4 times more each year, about how many times more does it cost after three years?", "min": 0, "max": 40, "value": 14, "unit": "x", "explanation": "2.4 × 2.4 × 2.4 is about 13.8. At that pace a $490 million run becomes several billion."}, {"kind": "multipleChoice", "id": "mc", "prompt": "What does Epoch's $490 million estimate for Grok 4 leave out?", "options": ["Staff, experiments and serving users", "The GPUs used in the final run", "The electricity for the final run"], "correctIndex": 0, "explanation": "It counts the final run only. Staff, experiments and serving can add a lot."}, {"kind": "faceOff", "id": "face", "prompt": "Same training run, two ways to count. Which estimate comes out higher?", "left": {"name": "Owned hardware", "note": "Chip cost spread over its life, plus energy"}, "right": {"name": "Cloud rental", "note": "Hourly prices paid to a cloud"}, "correctIndex": 1, "explanation": "Epoch found cloud estimates about twice as high on average."}, {"id": "lens-build_startup", "kind": "info", "title": "Stay off the cost curve", "body": "Frontier runs are heading past $1 billion. Startups do better building on trained models than racing that curve.", "eyebrow": "For founders", "sources": [{"url": "https://epoch.ai/publications/how-much-does-it-cost-to-train-frontier-ai-models", "label": "Epoch AI, How much does it cost to train frontier AI models?, Jun 2024"}]}, {"id": "rule", "kind": "microInsight", "text": "In AI, the bill for the biggest training run multiplies every year.", "eyebrow": "The rule", "sources": [{"url": "https://epoch.ai/publications/how-much-does-it-cost-to-train-frontier-ai-models", "label": "Epoch AI, How much does it cost to train frontier AI models?, Jun 2024"}, {"url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.21015", "label": "Cottier et al., The rising costs of training frontier AI models, 2024"}]}, {"id": "say-it", "kind": "sayIt", "takeaway": "Epoch put Grok 4's training at about $490 million. Frontier run costs grow about 2.4 times a year, and Epoch expects them to pass $1 billion by 2027 if that holds.", "sectionKey": "why_now"}]}$ml$::jsonb),
