ts", "label": "TechCrunch, Altman cites $20B ARR and about $1.4 trillion of commitments, Nov 2025"}, {"url": "https://www.thestar.com.my/tech/tech-news/2026/09/19/openai-forecasts-cash-burn-near-280-billion-by-2030-ft-reports", "label": "Reuters via The Star, OpenAI forecasts cash burn near $280 billion by 2030, Sep 2026"}]}, {"id": "rule", "kind": "microInsight", "text": "In AI, the arms race lasts only as long as revenue or investors keep paying for it.", "eyebrow": "The rule", "sources": [{"url": "https://www.thestar.com.my/tech/tech-news/2026/09/19/openai-forecasts-cash-burn-near-280-billion-by-2030-ft-reports", "label": "Reuters via The Star, OpenAI forecasts cash burn near $280 billion by 2030, Sep 2026"}, {"url": "https://www.bankofengland.co.uk/financial-policy-committee-record/2025/october-2025", "label": "Bank of England, Financial Policy Committee record, Oct 2025"}]}, {"id": "say-it", "kind": "sayIt", "takeaway": "OpenAI projects $278 billion of cash burn through 2030 and about $856 billion of compute. The race depends on revenue growing about tenfold.", "sectionKey": "review"}]}$ml$::jsonb),
