HF compute is small, but expert time is not. Mercor alone paid out more than $1.5 million a day.", "eyebrow": "For investors", "sources": [{"url": "https://techcrunch.com/2025/10/27/mercor-quintuples-valuation-to-10b-with-350m-series-c/", "label": "TechCrunch, Mercor quintuples valuation to $10B with $350M Series C, Oct 2025"}, {"url": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2203.02155", "label": "Ouyang et al., Training language models to follow instructions with human feedback, 2022"}]}, {"id": "rule", "kind": "microInsight", "text": "In AI feedback, the money follows scarce human judgment.", "eyebrow": "The rule", "sources": [{"url": "https://techcrunch.com/2025/10/27/mercor-quintuples-valuation-to-10b-with-350m-series-c/", "label": "TechCrunch, Mercor quintuples valuation to $10B with $350M Series C, Oct 2025"}, {"url": "https://www.aol.com/news/exclusive-scale-ais-bigger-rival-152327362.html", "label": "Reuters via AOL, Scale AI's bigger rival Surge AI seeks up to $1 billion, Jul 2025"}]}, {"id": "say-it", "kind": "sayIt", "takeaway": "Labs pay vendors, and vendors pay the people who write and rank answers. Mercor paid experts over $1.5 million a day in 2025, while one earlier contract left workers about $2 of each $12.50.", "sectionKey": "drivers"}]}$ml$::jsonb),
