($ml$4b05c373-4cc1-5fe7-88b2-0f309ebc0280$ml$::uuid, $ml$b459968b-7fc3-5afc-bdc2-c6f044d3cbdd$ml$::uuid, 1, $ml$Day 37 · Training costs$ml$, $ml$In 2024, OpenAI spent about $5 billion on R&D compute. Only about $500 million went to final training runs. A final training run is the one that produces a released model. Epoch AI estimated that such runs took roughly 10% of OpenAI's 2024 R&D compute spending. The rest went to scaling experiments, synthetic data, basic research and other R&D. So the headline cost of training a model is only a slice of what building it costs.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://epoch.ai/gradient-updates/r-and-d-vs-training-compute", "label": "Epoch AI, Final training runs account for a minority of R&D compute spending, Mar 2026"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$d1a95648-5ad4-5a1d-b3c9-fb1a11e09b89$ml$::uuid, $ml$b459968b-7fc3-5afc-bdc2-c6f044d3cbdd$ml$::uuid, 2, $ml$The hidden runs$ml$, $ml$Most research compute goes to runs that never become a product. Final runs took 22.6% of MiniMax's R&D compute and 12.3% of Z.ai's.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://epoch.ai/gradient-updates/r-and-d-vs-training-compute", "label": "Epoch AI, Final training runs account for a minority of R&D compute spending, Mar 2026"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$eccc21e7-36b5-59d7-95a3-e15771b80278$ml$::uuid, $ml$b459968b-7fc3-5afc-bdc2-c6f044d3cbdd$ml$::uuid, 3, $ml$The people$ml$, $ml$Compute is not the whole bill. People are a large share too. R&D staff made up 29% to 49% of development cost in Epoch's study.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://epoch.ai/publications/how-much-does-it-cost-to-train-frontier-ai-models", "label": "Epoch AI, How much does it cost to train frontier AI models?, Jun 2024"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$e01485a4-704e-5dcc-bb0b-52d2a7e7c6b0$ml$::uuid, $ml$b459968b-7fc3-5afc-bdc2-c6f044d3cbdd$ml$::uuid, 4, $ml$Chips first, people second, power last$ml$, $ml$Across four models including GPT-4 and Gemini Ultra, hardware was 47% to 67% of development cost. Energy was only 2% to 6%. Epoch's headline costs count hardware and energy for the final run only.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://epoch.ai/publications/how-much-does-it-cost-to-train-frontier-ai-models", "label": "Epoch AI, How much does it cost to train frontier AI models?, Jun 2024"}]$ml$::jsonb),
