($ml$56de7269-b45d-5eb5-baa2-f0ed4bca2cd8$ml$::uuid, $ml$7952a95d-e6d7-5094-bd21-f5b65094ceff$ml$::uuid, 1, $ml$Day 37 · Training costs$ml$, $ml$In 2024, OpenAI spent about $5 billion on R&D compute. Only about $500 million went to final training runs. A final training run is the one that produces a released model. Epoch AI estimated that such runs took roughly 10% of OpenAI's 2024 R&D compute spending. The rest went to scaling experiments, synthetic data, basic research and other R&D. So the headline cost of training a model is only a slice of what building it costs.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://epoch.ai/gradient-updates/r-and-d-vs-training-compute", "label": "Epoch AI, Final training runs account for a minority of R&D compute spending, Mar 2026"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$b193e704-5d14-55a4-b6a5-9c21b613d23b$ml$::uuid, $ml$7952a95d-e6d7-5094-bd21-f5b65094ceff$ml$::uuid, 2, $ml$The hidden runs$ml$, $ml$Most research compute goes to runs that never become a product. Final runs took 22.6% of MiniMax's R&D compute and 12.3% of Z.ai's.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://epoch.ai/gradient-updates/r-and-d-vs-training-compute", "label": "Epoch AI, Final training runs account for a minority of R&D compute spending, Mar 2026"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$373932e2-ef02-5749-8a1e-949d979bd43e$ml$::uuid, $ml$7952a95d-e6d7-5094-bd21-f5b65094ceff$ml$::uuid, 3, $ml$The people$ml$, $ml$Compute is not the whole bill. People are a large share too. R&D staff made up 29% to 49% of development cost in Epoch's study.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://epoch.ai/publications/how-much-does-it-cost-to-train-frontier-ai-models", "label": "Epoch AI, How much does it cost to train frontier AI models?, Jun 2024"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$9c09ba7b-a2b7-5471-aee8-633117a9c40e$ml$::uuid, $ml$7952a95d-e6d7-5094-bd21-f5b65094ceff$ml$::uuid, 4, $ml$Chips first, people second, power last$ml$, $ml$Across four models including GPT-4 and Gemini Ultra, hardware was 47% to 67% of development cost. Energy was only 2% to 6%. Epoch's headline costs count hardware and energy for the final run only.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://epoch.ai/publications/how-much-does-it-cost-to-train-frontier-ai-models", "label": "Epoch AI, How much does it cost to train frontier AI models?, Jun 2024"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$e30d8704-65d6-5ff1-9c28-39384b768f3f$ml$::uuid, $ml$7952a95d-e6d7-5094-bd21-f5b65094ceff$ml$::uuid, 5, $ml$Budget for the runs that fail$ml$, $ml$Most compute goes to experiments before the final run. Plan your budget around them, not just the run that ships.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://epoch.ai/gradient-updates/r-and-d-vs-training-compute", "label": "Epoch AI, Final training runs account for a minority of R&D compute spending, Mar 2026"}]$ml$::jsonb),
