($ml$aea7ba59-b14f-5710-9bd0-5a6eaa272cf6$ml$::uuid, $ml$a0f635ae-6a94-50fa-86e3-c2571ab32ed2$ml$::uuid, 5, $ml$Two rounds in seven weeks$ml$, $ml$Anthropic raised $30 billion in February 2026. OpenAI raised $122 billion at the end of March.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/anthropic-raises-30-billion-series-g-funding-380-billion-post-money-valuation", "label": "Anthropic, Series G at a $380 billion valuation, Feb 2026"}, {"url": "https://www.openai.com/index/accelerating-the-next-phase-ai/", "label": "OpenAI, Accelerating the next phase of AI, Mar 2026"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$7569c9d8-80ea-5de0-8765-b16a183fbdb7$ml$::uuid, $ml$a0f635ae-6a94-50fa-86e3-c2571ab32ed2$ml$::uuid, 6, $ml$The rule$ml$, $ml$In AI, the frontier is paid for with investors' money before it pays for itself.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.openai.com/index/accelerating-the-next-phase-ai/", "label": "OpenAI, Accelerating the next phase of AI, Mar 2026"}, {"url": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/anthropic-raises-30-billion-series-g-funding-380-billion-post-money-valuation", "label": "Anthropic, Series G at a $380 billion valuation, Feb 2026"}, {"url": "https://www.thestar.com.my/tech/tech-news/2026/09/19/openai-forecasts-cash-burn-near-280-billion-by-2030-ft-reports", "label": "Reuters via The Star, OpenAI forecasts cash burn near $280 billion by 2030, Sep 2026"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$3bd649a3-6593-575a-a03e-d7a4dcdf11b7$ml$::uuid, $ml$62ccbcdb-cace-560d-862f-c22232d9c5c3$ml$::uuid, 1, $ml$Day 39 · The power$ml$, $ml$In November 2025, Microsoft and NVIDIA pledged up to $15 billion to Anthropic. Anthropic pledged to buy $30 billion of Azure compute. NVIDIA committed up to $10 billion and Microsoft up to $5 billion. Its initial commitment of up to one gigawatt is for NVIDIA Grace Blackwell and Vera Rubin systems. Microsoft's Foundry customers also gained access to Claude models. The investors also sell the compute their money pays for.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/microsoft-nvidia-anthropic-announce-strategic-partnerships", "label": "Anthropic, Microsoft, NVIDIA and Anthropic announce strategic partnerships, Nov 2025"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$e224129a-bfdd-51bd-9319-bea768a2628d$ml$::uuid, $ml$62ccbcdb-cace-560d-862f-c22232d9c5c3$ml$::uuid, 2, $ml$The loop$ml$, $ml$A supplier invests in a lab, and the lab spends with the supplier. Anthropic's $30 billion Azure pledge is twice what its two backers pledged.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/microsoft-nvidia-anthropic-announce-strategic-partnerships", "label": "Anthropic, Microsoft, NVIDIA and Anthropic announce strategic partnerships, Nov 2025"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$0cb5da8c-3c00-5d10-844b-c8c9b01fe004$ml$::uuid, $ml$62ccbcdb-cace-560d-862f-c22232d9c5c3$ml$::uuid, 3, $ml$The same pattern$ml$, $ml$Microsoft owns about 27% of OpenAI, a stake valued around $135 billion. OpenAI committed to buy $250 billion of Azure services.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.scmp.com/tech/big-tech/article/3330714/microsoft-holds-27-openai-revamped-partnership", "label": "SCMP, Microsoft holds 27% of OpenAI in revamped partnership, Oct 2025"}, {"url": "https://rcpmag.com/Articles/2025/10/28/Microsoft-OpenAI-AGI.aspx", "label": "Redmond Channel Partner, Microsoft and OpenAI reset their deal, Oct 2025"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$a4ffea79-d839-566c-adc5-3fae6ceb110e$ml$::uuid, $ml$62ccbcdb-cace-560d-862f-c22232d9c5c3$ml$::uuid, 4, $ml$Labs push back by spreading out$ml$, $ml$In October 2025, Microsoft gave up its right of first refusal as OpenAI's compute provider. OpenAI now buys from several clouds. Anthropic runs on AWS Trainium, Google TPUs and NVIDIA GPUs.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://rcpmag.com/Articles/2025/10/28/Microsoft-OpenAI-AGI.aspx", "label": "Redmond Channel Partner, Microsoft and OpenAI reset their deal, Oct 2025"}, {"url": "https://www.openai.com/index/accelerating-the-next-phase-ai/", "label": "OpenAI, Accelerating the next phase of AI, Mar 2026"}, {"url": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/anthropic-raises-30-billion-series-g-funding-380-billion-post-money-valuation", "label": "Anthropic, Series G at a $380 billion valuation, Feb 2026"}]$ml$::jsonb),
