($ml$d55d0ab7-7672-5e7c-a517-f3542438be8c$ml$::uuid, $ml$1cf808ab-b190-5241-8bc7-70b2c106f96d$ml$::uuid, 5, $ml$Know what a backer expects$ml$, $ml$Chip and cloud firms invest in the labs that buy from them. Ask what a backer expects you to buy before you take its money.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/microsoft-nvidia-anthropic-announce-strategic-partnerships", "label": "Anthropic, Microsoft, NVIDIA and Anthropic announce strategic partnerships, Nov 2025"}, {"url": "https://www.scmp.com/tech/big-tech/article/3330714/microsoft-holds-27-openai-revamped-partnership", "label": "SCMP, Microsoft holds 27% of OpenAI in revamped partnership, Oct 2025"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$dc97a8aa-ffe1-5023-a080-221e4a4c6852$ml$::uuid, $ml$1cf808ab-b190-5241-8bc7-70b2c106f96d$ml$::uuid, 6, $ml$The rule$ml$, $ml$In AI, whoever sells the compute increasingly owns a piece of whoever buys it.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/microsoft-nvidia-anthropic-announce-strategic-partnerships", "label": "Anthropic, Microsoft, NVIDIA and Anthropic announce strategic partnerships, Nov 2025"}, {"url": "https://www.scmp.com/tech/big-tech/article/3330714/microsoft-holds-27-openai-revamped-partnership", "label": "SCMP, Microsoft holds 27% of OpenAI in revamped partnership, Oct 2025"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$39f32804-44ea-5946-be1f-9491213e06a1$ml$::uuid, $ml$2e367b32-4dc1-545a-9954-8b58f58efe9e$ml$::uuid, 1, $ml$Day 39 · The power$ml$, $ml$In November 2025, Microsoft and NVIDIA pledged up to $15 billion to Anthropic. Anthropic pledged to buy $30 billion of Azure compute. NVIDIA committed up to $10 billion and Microsoft up to $5 billion. Its initial commitment of up to one gigawatt is for NVIDIA Grace Blackwell and Vera Rubin systems. Microsoft's Foundry customers also gained access to Claude models. The investors also sell the compute their money pays for.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/microsoft-nvidia-anthropic-announce-strategic-partnerships", "label": "Anthropic, Microsoft, NVIDIA and Anthropic announce strategic partnerships, Nov 2025"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$c88ba049-1ce8-5142-94d7-c73f74df1703$ml$::uuid, $ml$2e367b32-4dc1-545a-9954-8b58f58efe9e$ml$::uuid, 2, $ml$The loop$ml$, $ml$A supplier invests in a lab, and the lab spends with the supplier. Anthropic's $30 billion Azure pledge is twice what its two backers pledged.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/microsoft-nvidia-anthropic-announce-strategic-partnerships", "label": "Anthropic, Microsoft, NVIDIA and Anthropic announce strategic partnerships, Nov 2025"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$324f51bb-134c-5268-bacf-cdc467f64b16$ml$::uuid, $ml$2e367b32-4dc1-545a-9954-8b58f58efe9e$ml$::uuid, 3, $ml$The same pattern$ml$, $ml$Microsoft owns about 27% of OpenAI, a stake valued around $135 billion. OpenAI committed to buy $250 billion of Azure services.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.scmp.com/tech/big-tech/article/3330714/microsoft-holds-27-openai-revamped-partnership", "label": "SCMP, Microsoft holds 27% of OpenAI in revamped partnership, Oct 2025"}, {"url": "https://rcpmag.com/Articles/2025/10/28/Microsoft-OpenAI-AGI.aspx", "label": "Redmond Channel Partner, Microsoft and OpenAI reset their deal, Oct 2025"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$1654019a-c0b5-52c8-a313-7b8759a979e1$ml$::uuid, $ml$2e367b32-4dc1-545a-9954-8b58f58efe9e$ml$::uuid, 4, $ml$Labs push back by spreading out$ml$, $ml$In October 2025, Microsoft gave up its right of first refusal as OpenAI's compute provider. OpenAI now buys from several clouds. Anthropic runs on AWS Trainium, Google TPUs and NVIDIA GPUs.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://rcpmag.com/Articles/2025/10/28/Microsoft-OpenAI-AGI.aspx", "label": "Redmond Channel Partner, Microsoft and OpenAI reset their deal, Oct 2025"}, {"url": "https://www.openai.com/index/accelerating-the-next-phase-ai/", "label": "OpenAI, Accelerating the next phase of AI, Mar 2026"}, {"url": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/anthropic-raises-30-billion-series-g-funding-380-billion-post-money-valuation", "label": "Anthropic, Series G at a $380 billion valuation, Feb 2026"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$72761d61-ceab-5344-9536-444f53904246$ml$::uuid, $ml$2e367b32-4dc1-545a-9954-8b58f58efe9e$ml$::uuid, 5, $ml$The money goes in a circle$ml$, $ml$NVIDIA invests in Anthropic, Anthropic rents Azure, and that Azure capacity runs on NVIDIA systems.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/microsoft-nvidia-anthropic-announce-strategic-partnerships", "label": "Anthropic, Microsoft, NVIDIA and Anthropic announce strategic partnerships, Nov 2025"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$486c0fba-c658-5d15-aa68-7348701d8898$ml$::uuid, $ml$2e367b32-4dc1-545a-9954-8b58f58efe9e$ml$::uuid, 6, $ml$The rule$ml$, $ml$In AI, whoever sells the compute increasingly owns a piece of whoever buys it.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/microsoft-nvidia-anthropic-announce-strategic-partnerships", "label": "Anthropic, Microsoft, NVIDIA and Anthropic announce strategic partnerships, Nov 2025"}, {"url": "https://www.scmp.com/tech/big-tech/article/3330714/microsoft-holds-27-openai-revamped-partnership", "label": "SCMP, Microsoft holds 27% of OpenAI in revamped partnership, Oct 2025"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$3edf5328-bb60-5057-a5bc-5c077d75b537$ml$::uuid, $ml$0574b0b0-6c75-535a-a923-3eb7544f00df$ml$::uuid, 1, $ml$Day 40 · The numbers$ml$, $ml$Epoch AI estimated that training xAI's Grok 4 cost about $490 million and 310 gigawatt-hours of electricity. Epoch published the estimate in September 2025. That much energy could power a town of 4,000 Americans. It leaves out staff, research experiments and serving users, which Epoch says can be very significant. Top labs no longer disclose details like training duration, so outsiders estimate.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://epoch.ai/data-insights/grok-4-training-resources", "label": "Epoch AI, Grok 4 training resources, Sep 2025"}, {"url": "https://hai.stanford.edu/assets/files/ai_index_report_2026_chapter_1_research_development.pdf", "label": "Stanford AI Index 2026, chapter 1, Research and Development"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$66119ce4-a27d-5032-92be-4f3faa993287$ml$::uuid, $ml$0574b0b0-6c75-535a-a923-3eb7544f00df$ml$::uuid, 2, $ml$The growth rate$ml$, $ml$The cost of the biggest training runs has grown about 2.4 times a year since 2016. That is Epoch's estimate, counting hardware and energy for the final run.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://epoch.ai/publications/how-much-does-it-cost-to-train-frontier-ai-models", "label": "Epoch AI, How much does it cost to train frontier AI models?, Jun 2024"}, {"url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.21015", "label": "Cottier et al., The rising costs of training frontier AI models, 2024"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$ca6deab5-e1d2-5e75-be3f-6ba1510b3a72$ml$::uuid, $ml$0574b0b0-6c75-535a-a923-3eb7544f00df$ml$::uuid, 3, $ml$Rent or own$ml$, $ml$How you count changes the number. Cloud rental estimates come out about twice as high as owned hardware.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://epoch.ai/publications/how-much-does-it-cost-to-train-frontier-ai-models", "label": "Epoch AI, How much does it cost to train frontier AI models?, Jun 2024"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$856713f7-57e2-562b-a614-01c987341275$ml$::uuid, $ml$0574b0b0-6c75-535a-a923-3eb7544f00df$ml$::uuid, 4, $ml$Runs over $1 billion by 2027$ml$, $ml$If the trend holds, Epoch expects the largest runs to cost more than $1 billion by 2027. That would keep the frontier to the best-funded labs. GPU compute per dollar doubles about every 2.1 years.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://epoch.ai/publications/how-much-does-it-cost-to-train-frontier-ai-models", "label": "Epoch AI, How much does it cost to train frontier AI models?, Jun 2024"}, {"url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.21015", "label": "Cottier et al., The rising costs of training frontier AI models, 2024"}, {"url": "https://epoch.ai/publications/trends-in-machine-learning-hardware", "label": "Epoch AI, Trends in machine learning hardware, Nov 2023"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$d840c941-20ff-5be5-a679-661af21bac2b$ml$::uuid, $ml$0574b0b0-6c75-535a-a923-3eb7544f00df$ml$::uuid, 5, $ml$Quote the 2.4x$ml$, $ml$The cost of frontier training runs grows about 2.4 times a year. Saying so shows you know why only a few labs compete.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://epoch.ai/publications/how-much-does-it-cost-to-train-frontier-ai-models", "label": "Epoch AI, How much does it cost to train frontier AI models?, Jun 2024"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$32e838a0-d291-511c-86a7-57c68c8c96b5$ml$::uuid, $ml$0574b0b0-6c75-535a-a923-3eb7544f00df$ml$::uuid, 6, $ml$The rule$ml$, $ml$In AI, the bill for the biggest training run multiplies every year.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://epoch.ai/publications/how-much-does-it-cost-to-train-frontier-ai-models", "label": "Epoch AI, How much does it cost to train frontier AI models?, Jun 2024"}, {"url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.21015", "label": "Cottier et al., The rising costs of training frontier AI models, 2024"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$3708c9e4-3132-53df-aa70-0d3e90410c48$ml$::uuid, $ml$cd906d42-5d89-5867-8c56-0b18eb61d7e9$ml$::uuid, 1, $ml$Day 40 · The numbers$ml$, $ml$Epoch AI estimated that training xAI's Grok 4 cost about $490 million and 310 gigawatt-hours of electricity. Epoch published the estimate in September 2025. That much energy could power a town of 4,000 Americans. It leaves out staff, research experiments and serving users, which Epoch says can be very significant. Top labs no longer disclose details like training duration, so outsiders estimate.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://epoch.ai/data-insights/grok-4-training-resources", "label": "Epoch AI, Grok 4 training resources, Sep 2025"}, {"url": "https://hai.stanford.edu/assets/files/ai_index_report_2026_chapter_1_research_development.pdf", "label": "Stanford AI Index 2026, chapter 1, Research and Development"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$9f38d888-8880-58f1-9c8d-f608ba8c97fc$ml$::uuid, $ml$cd906d42-5d89-5867-8c56-0b18eb61d7e9$ml$::uuid, 2, $ml$The growth rate$ml$, $ml$The cost of the biggest training runs has grown about 2.4 times a year since 2016. That is Epoch's estimate, counting hardware and energy for the final run.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://epoch.ai/publications/how-much-does-it-cost-to-train-frontier-ai-models", "label": "Epoch AI, How much does it cost to train frontier AI models?, Jun 2024"}, {"url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.21015", "label": "Cottier et al., The rising costs of training frontier AI models, 2024"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$589a5293-ed64-5b15-8b9c-195531af3c11$ml$::uuid, $ml$cd906d42-5d89-5867-8c56-0b18eb61d7e9$ml$::uuid, 3, $ml$Rent or own$ml$, $ml$How you count changes the number. Cloud rental estimates come out about twice as high as owned hardware.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://epoch.ai/publications/how-much-does-it-cost-to-train-frontier-ai-models", "label": "Epoch AI, How much does it cost to train frontier AI models?, Jun 2024"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$cc15039b-b0c6-55e6-bc77-9b91cedde418$ml$::uuid, $ml$cd906d42-5d89-5867-8c56-0b18eb61d7e9$ml$::uuid, 4, $ml$Runs over $1 billion by 2027$ml$, $ml$If the trend holds, Epoch expects the largest runs to cost more than $1 billion by 2027. That would keep the frontier to the best-funded labs. GPU compute per dollar doubles about every 2.1 years.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://epoch.ai/publications/how-much-does-it-cost-to-train-frontier-ai-models", "label": "Epoch AI, How much does it cost to train frontier AI models?, Jun 2024"}, {"url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.21015", "label": "Cottier et al., The rising costs of training frontier AI models, 2024"}, {"url": "https://epoch.ai/publications/trends-in-machine-learning-hardware", "label": "Epoch AI, Trends in machine learning hardware, Nov 2023"}]$ml$::jsonb),
