($ml$77a83506-5161-59e2-9ae2-d0ef948e2d72$ml$::uuid, $ml$aa725000-e464-56f6-b0ce-c68a3aaf044f$ml$::uuid, 5, $ml$Fine-tuners often sit below$ml$, $ml$Training at 10^25 costs tens of millions of dollars. In the EU, a fine-tuner becomes the provider only past a third of the original compute.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://epoch.ai/data-insights/models-over-1e25-flop", "label": "Epoch AI, Models over 10^25 FLOP"}, {"url": "https://digital-strategy.ec.europa.eu/en/faqs/guidelines-obligations-gpai-providers", "label": "European Commission, FAQ on obligations for general-purpose AI providers"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$bcca3991-fd38-570f-ac78-45ad43d77f92$ml$::uuid, $ml$aa725000-e464-56f6-b0ce-c68a3aaf044f$ml$::uuid, 6, $ml$The rule$ml$, $ml$In AI, the more compute a model takes, the more rules it has to meet.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.orrick.com/en/Insights/2025/10/Californias-Transparency-in-Frontier-Artificial-Intelligence-Act-5-Things-You-Should-Know", "label": "Orrick, California's Transparency in Frontier AI Act: 5 things to know, Oct 2025"}, {"url": "https://digital-strategy.ec.europa.eu/en/faqs/guidelines-obligations-gpai-providers", "label": "European Commission, FAQ on obligations for general-purpose AI providers"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$83b3d84d-e413-568e-912c-67dc00d71698$ml$::uuid, $ml$7c49b45b-94d8-581d-91ed-4322e80c5fc1$ml$::uuid, 1, $ml$Day 41 · The rules$ml$, $ml$Since January 1, 2026, California's SB 53 has applied to AI models trained with more than 10^26 operations. Governor Newsom signed the Transparency in Frontier Artificial Intelligence Act on September 29, 2025. The count includes the original run plus later fine-tuning and reinforcement learning. Developers must publish a transparency report before deploying a new frontier model and report critical safety incidents within 15 days. Penalties reach $1 million.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.orrick.com/en/Insights/2025/10/Californias-Transparency-in-Frontier-Artificial-Intelligence-Act-5-Things-You-Should-Know", "label": "Orrick, California's Transparency in Frontier AI Act: 5 things to know, Oct 2025"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$3da6c7e8-7ac8-593b-ad9a-3755cf57731b$ml$::uuid, $ml$7c49b45b-94d8-581d-91ed-4322e80c5fc1$ml$::uuid, 2, $ml$The big developers$ml$, $ml$Some duties apply only to developers with more than $500 million in revenue. They must publish a framework for how they manage catastrophic risk.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.orrick.com/en/Insights/2025/10/Californias-Transparency-in-Frontier-Artificial-Intelligence-Act-5-Things-You-Should-Know", "label": "Orrick, California's Transparency in Frontier AI Act: 5 things to know, Oct 2025"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$c9ab23ad-5ccf-5468-92e3-eb60fcaf5234$ml$::uuid, $ml$7c49b45b-94d8-581d-91ed-4322e80c5fc1$ml$::uuid, 3, $ml$The EU line$ml$, $ml$The EU draws its line ten times lower, at 10^25 operations. Above it, a model is presumed to carry systemic risk.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://digital-strategy.ec.europa.eu/en/faqs/guidelines-obligations-gpai-providers", "label": "European Commission, FAQ on obligations for general-purpose AI providers"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$b49f5532-ca10-58cb-93fb-e9969706f90f$ml$::uuid, $ml$7c49b45b-94d8-581d-91ed-4322e80c5fc1$ml$::uuid, 4, $ml$Over 30 models had crossed 10^25$ml$, $ml$By June 2025, over 30 announced models from 12 developers had passed 10^25. GPT-4 was the first, in March 2023. Training at that scale costs tens of millions of dollars.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://epoch.ai/data-insights/models-over-1e25-flop", "label": "Epoch AI, Models over 10^25 FLOP"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$6b6cba36-30a0-5779-9e28-c0efed21690a$ml$::uuid, $ml$7c49b45b-94d8-581d-91ed-4322e80c5fc1$ml$::uuid, 5, $ml$Laws that count math$ml$, $ml$California and the EU now regulate AI partly by how many operations went into training it.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.orrick.com/en/Insights/2025/10/Californias-Transparency-in-Frontier-Artificial-Intelligence-Act-5-Things-You-Should-Know", "label": "Orrick, California's Transparency in Frontier AI Act: 5 things to know, Oct 2025"}, {"url": "https://digital-strategy.ec.europa.eu/en/faqs/guidelines-obligations-gpai-providers", "label": "European Commission, FAQ on obligations for general-purpose AI providers"}]$ml$::jsonb),
