($ml$69408b3b-a232-5002-80b4-d6f9490fb8b5$ml$::uuid, $ml$ef42e130-8c01-5c89-acc8-50bc231d6e9c$ml$::uuid, 1, $ml$Day 42 · Where it breaks$ml$, $ml$In September 2026, OpenAI projected it would burn $278 billion in cash from 2026 to 2030. The Financial Times reported the figures from a company presentation. OpenAI expects to spend about $856 billion on compute and infrastructure by the end of 2030, its largest cost. It forecasts revenue rising from $36 billion this year to $350 billion in 2030. It was on track to use up its March raise by 2028.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.thestar.com.my/tech/tech-news/2026/09/19/openai-forecasts-cash-burn-near-280-billion-by-2030-ft-reports", "label": "Reuters via The Star, OpenAI forecasts cash burn near $280 billion by 2030, Sep 2026"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$019554c4-c540-5f76-92d1-a8a172f83f09$ml$::uuid, $ml$ef42e130-8c01-5c89-acc8-50bc231d6e9c$ml$::uuid, 2, $ml$The commitments$ml$, $ml$In November 2025, Sam Altman cited about $1.4 trillion of data center commitments over eight years. OpenAI then expected above $20 billion of annualized revenue.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://techcrunch.com/2025/11/06/sam-altman-says-openai-has-20b-arr-and-about-1-4-trillion-in-data-center-commitments", "label": "TechCrunch, Altman cites $20B ARR and about $1.4 trillion of commitments, Nov 2025"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$147fc62e-6a55-5dfc-a379-9f4b1aa09abb$ml$::uuid, $ml$ef42e130-8c01-5c89-acc8-50bc231d6e9c$ml$::uuid, 3, $ml$The warning$ml$, $ml$Central banks are watching the valuations behind the race. In October 2025, the Bank of England said the risk of a sharp market correction had increased.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.bankofengland.co.uk/financial-policy-committee-record/2025/october-2025", "label": "Bank of England, Financial Policy Committee record, Oct 2025"}]$ml$::jsonb),
