($ml$21394036-7093-5fb7-9727-69ab99cb0860$ml$::uuid, $ml$7b24f50c-9a8a-50c7-a744-108dd263323b$ml$::uuid, 6, $ml$The rule$ml$, $ml$In AI, the arms race lasts only as long as revenue or investors keep paying for it.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.thestar.com.my/tech/tech-news/2026/09/19/openai-forecasts-cash-burn-near-280-billion-by-2030-ft-reports", "label": "Reuters via The Star, OpenAI forecasts cash burn near $280 billion by 2030, Sep 2026"}, {"url": "https://www.bankofengland.co.uk/financial-policy-committee-record/2025/october-2025", "label": "Bank of England, Financial Policy Committee record, Oct 2025"}]$ml$::jsonb),
