($ml$e9958b3d-2f55-5d14-ac1b-32e6c5e3e981$ml$::uuid, $ml$8b3807df-5c09-5564-af3d-5cb0db6e6e54$ml$::uuid, 2, $ml$The commitments$ml$, $ml$In November 2025, Sam Altman cited about $1.4 trillion of data center commitments over eight years. OpenAI then expected above $20 billion of annualized revenue.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://techcrunch.com/2025/11/06/sam-altman-says-openai-has-20b-arr-and-about-1-4-trillion-in-data-center-commitments", "label": "TechCrunch, Altman cites $20B ARR and about $1.4 trillion of commitments, Nov 2025"}]$ml$::jsonb),
