($ml$938c8570-8559-50e7-ab61-d7ea7d16d181$ml$::uuid, $ml$cb5b7148-0481-560c-897c-ca66aff48c8d$ml$::uuid, 5, $ml$Workers see little of the price$ml$, $ml$In one contract signed in late 2021, workers kept about $2 of each $12.50 an hour. Fair, skilled feedback supply is a gap to test.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://time.com/6247678/openai-chatgpt-kenya-workers/", "label": "TIME, OpenAI used Kenyan workers on less than $2 per hour, Jan 2023"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$65a05378-c845-588e-9ef0-9c9362cd3f5f$ml$::uuid, $ml$cb5b7148-0481-560c-897c-ca66aff48c8d$ml$::uuid, 6, $ml$The rule$ml$, $ml$In AI feedback, the money follows scarce human judgment.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://techcrunch.com/2025/10/27/mercor-quintuples-valuation-to-10b-with-350m-series-c/", "label": "TechCrunch, Mercor quintuples valuation to $10B with $350M Series C, Oct 2025"}, {"url": "https://www.aol.com/news/exclusive-scale-ais-bigger-rival-152327362.html", "label": "Reuters via AOL, Scale AI's bigger rival Surge AI seeks up to $1 billion, Jul 2025"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$84369b3e-541a-5a59-b227-b38280b4858b$ml$::uuid, $ml$6c30c9c3-f197-5c19-b068-3a3dcb8c976e$ml$::uuid, 1, $ml$Day 44 · The money$ml$, $ml$In October 2025, Mercor said it paid its contractors more than $1.5 million a day to help train AI models. Mercor connects AI labs with domain experts, such as scientists, doctors and lawyers, who train foundation models. It had more than 30,000 experts on its roster, earning over $85 an hour on average. That month it raised $350 million at a $10 billion valuation.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://techcrunch.com/2025/10/27/mercor-quintuples-valuation-to-10b-with-350m-series-c/", "label": "TechCrunch, Mercor quintuples valuation to $10B with $350M Series C, Oct 2025"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$2b2f53ef-0c94-51bd-aecd-4f8c5d9798b9$ml$::uuid, $ml$6c30c9c3-f197-5c19-b068-3a3dcb8c976e$ml$::uuid, 2, $ml$Who pays whom$ml$, $ml$Labs pay vendors, and vendors pay the people who write and rank answers. InstructGPT used about 40 contractors hired on Upwork and through Scale AI.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2203.02155", "label": "Ouyang et al., Training language models to follow instructions with human feedback, 2022"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$4cd0562a-edda-5fef-86f4-be0468bb5e1d$ml$::uuid, $ml$6c30c9c3-f197-5c19-b068-3a3dcb8c976e$ml$::uuid, 3, $ml$Where the margin sits$ml$, $ml$The vendor keeps the gap between what a lab pays and what workers earn. OpenAI paid Sama $12.50 an hour; its Kenyan workers took home about $1.32 to $2.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://time.com/6247678/openai-chatgpt-kenya-workers/", "label": "TIME, OpenAI used Kenyan workers on less than $2 per hour, Jan 2023"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$009989ca-9df1-5bab-ad66-398b2486d02f$ml$::uuid, $ml$6c30c9c3-f197-5c19-b068-3a3dcb8c976e$ml$::uuid, 4, $ml$From cheap labels to expert judgment$ml$, $ml$Feedback work has moved toward highly skilled contractors instead of large pools of low-wage labor. Expert hours cost far more. Mercor's experts earned over $85 an hour on average.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.aol.com/news/exclusive-scale-ais-bigger-rival-152327362.html", "label": "Reuters via AOL, Scale AI's bigger rival Surge AI seeks up to $1 billion, Jul 2025"}, {"url": "https://techcrunch.com/2025/10/27/mercor-quintuples-valuation-to-10b-with-350m-series-c/", "label": "TechCrunch, Mercor quintuples valuation to $10B with $350M Series C, Oct 2025"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$2377dbcd-bddb-55a4-83d9-569357ab49d4$ml$::uuid, $ml$6c30c9c3-f197-5c19-b068-3a3dcb8c976e$ml$::uuid, 5, $ml$Real people taught your chatbot$ml$, $ml$Chatbots learn manners from people who write and rank answers. Some earned $2 an hour, others over $85.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://time.com/6247678/openai-chatgpt-kenya-workers/", "label": "TIME, OpenAI used Kenyan workers on less than $2 per hour, Jan 2023"}, {"url": "https://techcrunch.com/2025/10/27/mercor-quintuples-valuation-to-10b-with-350m-series-c/", "label": "TechCrunch, Mercor quintuples valuation to $10B with $350M Series C, Oct 2025"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$fb976432-7fb4-544c-814e-30f0083d7264$ml$::uuid, $ml$6c30c9c3-f197-5c19-b068-3a3dcb8c976e$ml$::uuid, 6, $ml$The rule$ml$, $ml$In AI feedback, the money follows scarce human judgment.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://techcrunch.com/2025/10/27/mercor-quintuples-valuation-to-10b-with-350m-series-c/", "label": "TechCrunch, Mercor quintuples valuation to $10B with $350M Series C, Oct 2025"}, {"url": "https://www.aol.com/news/exclusive-scale-ais-bigger-rival-152327362.html", "label": "Reuters via AOL, Scale AI's bigger rival Surge AI seeks up to $1 billion, Jul 2025"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$b151bf4e-3be1-5df8-a857-8fabc0c99c24$ml$::uuid, $ml$d2ac0ab1-66c6-523b-bbe8-9d2116c8dea1$ml$::uuid, 1, $ml$Day 45 · The power$ml$, $ml$In 2023, researchers broke GPT-3.5 Turbo's safety guardrails by fine-tuning it on just 10 examples. It cost them less than $0.20. Researchers from Princeton, Virginia Tech, IBM Research and Stanford used OpenAI's own fine-tuning service. After training on 10 harmful examples, the model would respond to nearly any harmful instruction. They also found that fine-tuning on ordinary, harmless datasets can weaken safety too, though less.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2310.03693v1", "label": "Qi et al., Fine-tuning aligned language models compromises safety, Oct 2023"}, {"url": "https://www.theregister.com/2023/10/12/chatbot_defenses_dissolve/", "label": "The Register, chatbot defenses dissolve with fine-tuning, Oct 2023"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$23933cf8-37a9-5889-871c-7f0c2896a3a5$ml$::uuid, $ml$d2ac0ab1-66c6-523b-bbe8-9d2116c8dea1$ml$::uuid, 2, $ml$The last word$ml$, $ml$Safety training is just more training. Later fine-tuning can overwrite it. Ten examples were enough to reverse the guardrails of GPT-3.5 Turbo.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2310.03693v1", "label": "Qi et al., Fine-tuning aligned language models compromises safety, Oct 2023"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$632a5bab-1026-52b9-94bb-ce50ab6c16cc$ml$::uuid, $ml$d2ac0ab1-66c6-523b-bbe8-9d2116c8dea1$ml$::uuid, 3, $ml$Even by accident$ml$, $ml$Fine-tuning on harmless, common datasets also weakened safety, to a lesser degree. Customers can erode guardrails without meaning to.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2310.03693v1", "label": "Qi et al., Fine-tuning aligned language models compromises safety, Oct 2023"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$49b83711-40b3-5f9e-9c05-24a136f76f0b$ml$::uuid, $ml$d2ac0ab1-66c6-523b-bbe8-9d2116c8dea1$ml$::uuid, 4, $ml$Hosted fine-tuning keeps a veto$ml$, $ml$A provider that hosts fine-tuning can test and watch the results. Anyone holding open weights can fine-tune them alone. OpenAI runs automated safety evaluations on fine-tuned GPT-4o models.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://openai.com/index/gpt-4o-fine-tuning/", "label": "OpenAI, Fine-tuning now available for GPT-4o, Aug 2024"}, {"url": "https://www.theregister.com/2023/10/12/chatbot_defenses_dissolve/", "label": "The Register, chatbot defenses dissolve with fine-tuning, Oct 2023"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$043129c3-648b-5cf8-9d02-ff9deb2602ee$ml$::uuid, $ml$d2ac0ab1-66c6-523b-bbe8-9d2116c8dea1$ml$::uuid, 5, $ml$Know who holds the veto$ml$, $ml$Ask whether a model is tuned through a hosted service or from open weights. That decides who can stop a bad fine-tune.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://openai.com/index/gpt-4o-fine-tuning/", "label": "OpenAI, Fine-tuning now available for GPT-4o, Aug 2024"}, {"url": "https://www.theregister.com/2023/10/12/chatbot_defenses_dissolve/", "label": "The Register, chatbot defenses dissolve with fine-tuning, Oct 2023"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$c9711bd2-4d76-56e5-985a-5814f4b6dc92$ml$::uuid, $ml$d2ac0ab1-66c6-523b-bbe8-9d2116c8dea1$ml$::uuid, 6, $ml$The rule$ml$, $ml$In AI, whoever fine-tunes a model last decides how it behaves.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2310.03693v1", "label": "Qi et al., Fine-tuning aligned language models compromises safety, Oct 2023"}, {"url": "https://www.theregister.com/2023/10/12/chatbot_defenses_dissolve/", "label": "The Register, chatbot defenses dissolve with fine-tuning, Oct 2023"}]$ml$::jsonb),
