($ml$ba2d469f-61a4-5786-b98b-1f7308ee6b05$ml$::uuid, $ml$64610c03-f37d-51c4-913c-45e14013d4b2$ml$::uuid, 1, $ml$Day 56 · The money$ml$, $ml$Mistral gives away many of its models. Its annual revenue run rate still went from $20 million to over $400 million in a year. Mistral's CEO Arthur Mensch told the Financial Times in February 2026 that its annualized run rate was north of $400 million, up from $20 million a year earlier. The Paris company was founded in 2023 and publishes models anyone can download. Its paying customers include ASML, TotalEnergies and HSBC.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.hl.co.uk/shares/stock-market-news/company--news/mistral-invests-in-swedish-infrastructure-as-annual-revenues-top-$400m", "label": "Sharecast via Hargreaves Lansdown, Mistral revenues top $400m, Feb 2026"}, {"url": "https://startupfortune.com/mistral-ai-at-20-billion-is-a-bet-on-european-sovereign-ai-coming-into-its-own/", "label": "Startup Fortune, Mistral AI at 20 billion, Jun 2026"}]$ml$::jsonb),
